#x27; (fixed-rate pricing, LEASE_LTV gate).&amp;#10;down_payment onward is covered by the Lease State Machine diagram." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1592" width="560" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>